* Circle\nUpgradableMSCA
** Two generations
*** v0.7 — plugins,\nPluginManager delegatecall
*** v0.7 is the deployed one
*** v0.8 — modules,\nERC-6900 v0.8 aligned
*** v0.8 not on mainnet yet
** UpgradableMSCA\n(the thin layer)
*** ACCOUNT_ID\n"circle.msca.2.0.0"
*** initializeWithValidation()
*** DefaultCallbackHandler\n(721 / 1155 / 777)
*** upgradeToAndCall via\nwrapNativeExecutionFunction
*** _authorizeUpgrade is empty\nby design
** BaseMSCA\n(the engine)
*** validateUserOp / executeUserOp
*** execute / executeBatch
*** executeWithRuntimeValidation
*** install / uninstall\nvalidation and execution
*** fallback dispatch\nto module selectors
** Storage
*** ERC-7201 namespaced slot
*** "circle.msca.v2.storage",\n256-aligned
*** executionStorage\nby selector
*** validationStorage\nby ModuleEntity
*** supportedInterfaces\nas a counter
** Validation model
*** ModuleEntity =\naddress ‖ uint32 entityId
*** global vs per-selector
*** signature = entity(24)\n‖ flag(1) ‖ segments
*** flags: isGlobal,\nisSignature, isUserOp
*** validation data intersected\nacross hooks
** Hooks
*** validation hooks\n(pre-userOp / pre-runtime)
*** execution hooks,\nvalidation-associated
*** execution hooks,\nselector-associated
*** post hooks run in\nreverse order
** Guard rails
*** execute may not\ntarget the account
*** executeBatch self-calls\nonly at top level
*** RequireUserOperationContext
*** native / 4337 / IModule\nselectors cannot be installed
** Factory
*** CREATE2 on\nkeccak(sender ‖ salt)
*** module allowlist,\nowner-controlled
*** Ownable2Step,\nrenounce disabled
*** staked at the EntryPoint
** Shipped modules
*** SingleSignerValidation
*** WeightedMultisigValidation\n(EOA, 1271, P-256)
*** ColdStorageAddressBook
